   Perdan, Slobodan; Azapagic, Adisa, Univ Manchester, Sch Chem Engn \& Analyt Sci, Manchester M13 9PL, Lancs, England.
   Jones, Christopher R., Univ Sheffield, Dept Psychol, Environm \& Behav Res Grp, Sheffield S10 2TP, S Yorkshire, England.
   Jones, Christopher R., Univ Sheffield, UK Ctr Carbon Dioxide Utilisat CDUUK, Sheffield S10 2TN, S Yorkshire, England.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.spc.2017.01.001},
ISSN = {2352-5509},
Keywords = {Public acceptance; Public awareness; Carbon capture and utilisation;
