   Alencar, Pedro Henrique Lima; Paton, Eva Nora, Tech Univ Berlin, Inst Ecol, Ernst Reuter Pl 1, D-10587 Berlin, Germany.
   Sodoge, Jan; de Brito, Mariana Madruga, Helmholtz Ctr Environm Res, Dept Urban \& Environm Sociol, Permoserstr 15, D-04318 Leipzig, Germany.},
